00:59:26.262 --> 00:59:27.695
I understand that.


00:59:29.766 --> 00:59:30.824
Where is your family?


00:59:31.301 --> 00:59:32.495
My family's gone.


00:59:32.635 --> 00:59:34.626
I see that in your eyes.


00:59:34.771 --> 00:59:37.262
You are the man who put others
ahead of himself,


00:59:37.407 --> 00:59:41.867
not to garner others' respect, but
simply because it's your very nature.


00:59:42.011 --> 00:59:45.412
You saved my son and for that,
I'm beyond grateful.


00:59:45.548 --> 00:59:49.848
Please tell me what you need. If it's
within my power, I will make it happen.


00:59:49.986 --> 00:59:53.114
I don't like to start a fight
unless I finish it and...


00:59:54.391 --> 00:59:56.416
After this, now they have her uncle.


00:59:56.559 --> 00:59:58.857
And if we don't step in,
they'll kill him.


00:59:59.396 --> 01:00:04.390
That is a serious problem.
Where was this place they had you?


01:00:04.534 --> 01:00:07.992
It was an abandoned mill
about 50 miles out of town,


01:00:08.138 --> 01:00:10.003
not too far from the border.


01:00:10.240 --> 01:00:14.802
Chen's place. Very secluded.
He likes to do business out there.


01:00:14.944 --> 01:00:16.605
So you know this man?


01:00:16.746 --> 01:00:17.906
Of course.


01:00:18.047 --> 01:00:19.537
What do you think?


01:00:21.484 --> 01:00:23.577
From now on, you're my brother.


01:01:06.996 --> 01:01:08.691
You son of a bitch.


01:01:08.832 --> 01:01:10.595
You should be dead by now.


01:01:11.367 --> 01:01:15.701
I just wanted to make sure the Uncle
arrives before you screw that up, too.


01:01:15.839 --> 01:01:18.933
My associates will retaliate.


01:01:19.075 --> 01:01:22.943
You know, they rely on me
to deliver their product across.


01:01:23.079 --> 01:01:25.775
There's... there's a lot of money
at stake here.


01:01:31.588 --> 01:01:32.987
You think you matter?


01:01:37.393 --> 01:01:39.258
You think I was going to pay you?


01:01:41.264 --> 01:01:46.258
The only reason I came to you
to intercept the Uncle


01:01:46.402 --> 01:01:51.738
was because you were easy to manipulate.
And I was right.


01:01:51.875 --> 01:01:56.869
You think your Dadu background
and training make you untouchable?


01:01:58.448 --> 01:02:01.679
It doesn't. He's coming. You'll see.


01:02:01.818 --> 01:02:04.787
The Dadu are the highest-ranked warriors
of the Chinese people,


01:02:04.921 --> 01:02:06.912
something you know nothing about.


01:02:09.692 --> 01:02:12.661
I tell you what. I will do you a favor.


01:02:14.063 --> 01:02:19.899
I will unite you
with your 9-year-old boy lover.


01:02:23.940 --> 01:02:25.066
Happy?


01:02:27.744 --> 01:02:29.234
Goddamn it!


01:02:32.715 --> 01:02:33.807
Did I hit a nerve?


01:04:10.813 --> 01:04:12.075
We're in.


01:04:30.500 --> 01:04:34.231
Don't make a sound. Answer me
by nodding or shaking your head.


01:04:34.370 --> 01:04:36.133
Is the girl still here?


01:04:37.040 --> 01:04:39.372
- Is the man still with her?
- Yes.


01:04:43.913 --> 01:04:46.074
- Fuck me. They know we're here.
- Let her go!


01:04:46.616 --> 01:04:49.141
Fuck you! Put your fucking gun down.


01:04:53.556 --> 01:04:56.047
I said put your fucking gun down!


01:05:25.788 --> 01:05:27.449
Give me a couple more mags, man.


01:05:31.461 --> 01:05:33.361
All right, I got these guys.
You get the guys in the front.


01:05:33.496 --> 01:05:35.794
Sergey will take you down below.


01:05:37.066 --> 01:05:38.226
Save some for me.


01:05:44.307 --> 01:05:45.934
You guys keep going. I'll double back.


01:05:50.580 --> 01:05:54.311
It reminds me of the old days. Let's go!


01:07:05.388 --> 01:07:07.151
Get 'em out of here! I'll cover you.


01:10:09.872 --> 01:10:10.861
Tia!


01:10:22.051 --> 01:10:25.543
Ritchie, I've got her! We're coming out
the side exit! Get the car ready!


01:10:28.524 --> 01:10:29.513
Tia, run.


01:10:35.064 --> 01:10:36.224
Who the fuck are you?


01:10:40.302 --> 01:10:41.291
Fuck!


01:11:39.061 --> 01:11:41.859
It's me! It's me! All right?
Come on, let's go. This way.


01:11:41.997 --> 01:11:43.658
- But Shane is...
- He can take care of himself, OK?


01:11:43.799 --> 01:11:44.993
Let's go. Come on.


01:11:53.309 --> 01:11:56.073
I fucking knew it. I told you. Shit!


01:12:02.685 --> 01:12:03.845
Fuck it.


01:12:08.657 --> 01:12:10.124
Come on, you fuckers.


01:12:13.395 --> 01:12:15.386
Sergey! Get down!


01:12:15.831 --> 01:12:17.355
- Get down!
- Vlad, clear!


01:12:39.054 --> 01:12:41.113
That took balls, young man.
You did good.


01:13:04.213 --> 01:13:06.374
You did well, Sergey. You did well.


01:13:07.216 --> 01:13:08.547
Shane?


01:13:09.652 --> 01:13:14.612
You've heard my speech,
and now you've saved both of our lives.


01:13:14.757 --> 01:13:17.248
What I want to know is,
how can I help you?


01:13:17.393 --> 01:13:20.920
I have friends all around the world.


01:13:21.063 --> 01:13:22.758
You have the cash.


01:13:22.898 --> 01:13:25.765
I can help you start a new life
in a new place.


01:13:26.101 --> 01:13:28.296
Is that not what you wanted all along?


01:13:28.437 --> 01:13:31.634
Well, I'm gonna take care of her uncle,
and then we'll talk.


01:13:31.774 --> 01:13:33.969
Then I will go with you on this
as far as it goes.


01:13:34.109 --> 01:13:35.167
Great.


01:13:35.311 --> 01:13:37.279
I'm with you, too.


01:13:37.413 --> 01:13:38.710
I'm coming, too.


01:13:39.748 --> 01:13:42.410
So... let's go.


01:13:51.694 --> 01:13:53.252
Looks like they're dug in.


01:14:00.336 --> 01:14:01.963
Let's go join the party.


01:14:46.515 --> 01:14:49.143
Be on your toes.
They're not answering the radio.


01:15:28.190 --> 01:15:30.556
You'd better pray the Uncle is here.


01:15:37.800 --> 01:15:40.701
Let me know when the charges
are all set and ready.


01:16:03.892 --> 01:16:04.984
Let's go!


01:16:19.007 --> 01:16:22.204
- We are here.
- Where the hell is Chen?


01:16:31.920 --> 01:16:33.444
That's him. That's my uncle.


01:16:40.629 --> 01:16:42.995
Wait a minute.
We got another player here.


01:16:45.167 --> 01:16:46.464
It's an ambush.


01:16:46.602 --> 01:16:48.092
They won't have a chance.


01:18:37.679 --> 01:18:41.080
You finally did something right.
The Uncle has arrived.


01:19:21.757 --> 01:19:23.418
Sergey! You go.


01:19:23.559 --> 01:19:25.686
Tia, stay low.
I'm gonna go outflank them.


01:21:30.886 --> 01:21:33.411
- Shane! You're all right!
- Let's go.


01:21:58.513 --> 01:21:59.605
Sergey!


01:21:59.748 --> 01:22:03.115
Give me a shirt and a coat from
one of those dead guys right away.


01:22:03.885 --> 01:22:05.079
Quickly!


01:22:14.663 --> 01:22:17.427
You're gonna be all right.
You're gonna be all right.


01:22:19.601 --> 01:22:20.693
You hear me?


01:22:23.505 --> 01:22:24.767
Talk to me.


01:22:28.376 --> 01:22:29.502
I know.


01:22:30.579 --> 01:22:31.876
Shane?


01:22:32.013 --> 01:22:34.573
- Yes, baby.
- Am I gonna die?


01:22:34.716 --> 01:22:37.082
No. You're not gonna die.


01:22:37.519 --> 01:22:41.080
You hear me? You're not gonna die.


01:22:42.891 --> 01:22:45.052
All right, listen to me.
I got something to do.


01:22:45.494 --> 01:22:46.961
I'll be right back.


01:22:47.796 --> 01:22:52.859
OK... get on your left side. You OK?


01:22:53.001 --> 01:22:56.027
Stay just like this... you hear me?


01:22:56.171 --> 01:22:57.502
You all right?


01:22:57.806 --> 01:23:00.536
Sergey? Watch her for me.


01:23:02.010 --> 01:23:03.602
OK, baby,
I'll be right back.


01:23:03.745 --> 01:23:05.610
- OK.
- I'll be right back.


01:24:29.231 --> 01:24:30.858
We have to get out of here, OK?


01:24:30.999 --> 01:24:34.594
OK? I'm sorry about this.
I'm sorry about this.


01:25:17.913 --> 01:25:20.882
Come on. Come on, now. Hang in there.


01:25:21.016 --> 01:25:23.712
Almost there, OK?
Almost there. Come on.


01:25:23.952 --> 01:25:27.513
Right through here. Through here.
Stay with me. Stay with me.


01:25:27.656 --> 01:25:30.784
Right here. OK? We're going down.
We're going down, OK?


01:25:30.926 --> 01:25:36.421
OK, here you go.
All right, stay there. All right, stay.


01:25:52.147 --> 01:25:53.136
Come in.


01:25:56.651 --> 01:25:57.845
Come on in.


01:26:05.293 --> 01:26:08.285
- Have a seat.
- Maybe later.


01:26:10.031 --> 01:26:14.092
Who are you? What do you want?


01:26:14.235 --> 01:26:17.762
Well, unfortunately,
in the fabricating of your plans,


01:26:17.906 --> 01:26:20.431
you inadvertently
stepped into my minefield.


01:26:20.575 --> 01:26:24.944
And to answer the second part
of your question, I want you dead.


01:26:28.583 --> 01:26:32.075
I did not believe you were that good
until you dispatched my men.


01:26:32.220 --> 01:26:36.179
Very impressive. But let's
get down to business, shall we?


01:26:36.558 --> 01:26:40.927
You want the old man?
You pay with your life.


01:26:41.062 --> 01:26:46.466
You know, brother, where I come from,
the definition of death is emptiness.


01:26:46.601 --> 01:26:52.130
If that's the case, I've been dead
for a long, long, long time.


01:26:54.542 --> 01:26:57.705
Well, it looks like we're in a room
with 3 dead men.


01:28:00.542 --> 01:28:02.271
All right, let's go!


01:28:12.120 --> 01:28:14.145
Come on. Somebody wants to see you.


01:28:14.289 --> 01:28:15.950
Where... where is Shane?


01:28:16.091 --> 01:28:18.082
He's coming. He's coming, OK?


01:28:18.226 --> 01:28:19.318
He's on his way.


01:28:19.461 --> 01:28:23.261
He's coming, all right?
OK? It's gonna be OK.


01:28:23.398 --> 01:28:24.387
Sergey!


01:29:40.508 --> 01:29:42.408
Shane, look out!


01:30:49.611 --> 01:30:52.273
Everybody's waiting for us downstairs.


01:30:54.449 --> 01:30:56.314
I've got something
more important than that.


01:30:57.252 --> 01:30:59.413
Your smuggling days are over,
that's for sure.


01:30:59.554 --> 01:31:00.885
Does that mean what I think it means?


01:31:01.022 --> 01:31:03.752
Guess what? Vlad just called,
and your uncle can stay.


01:31:05.426 --> 01:31:08.486
Thank you, Shane... for everything.


01:31:12.300 --> 01:31:14.928
All right, sweetheart,
let's go celebrate.


01:31:15.069 --> 01:31:16.764
I got a new home.

